    "This first approved Characters ingestion map captures the coarse source-side structure only: four top-level regions, one excluded palette/byline strip, and neutral per-set collections.",
    "The top head-study band is intentionally left as one coarse collection for now. Fine-grained head/body swap structure should be added in a later manual review pass rather than guessed here.",
    "Large figures from this sheet still need explicit runtime promotion as constructions or another compound asset surface; this ingest map does not settle that runtime representation.",
    "The head-study row also suggests a future attachment/decorator surface for alternate heads and possibly held items, but that runtime support should follow a deliberate review pass instead of being inferred here.",
    "Measured standalone heads on the right side of the head-study row span two source columns and bleed into the second source row; the conservative runtime assumption is therefore a small multi-cell attachment surface rather than single-tile head decorators."
  ]
